  "observations": [
    "AOSP16 XSD requires partition; derived factory XML validates against it. Selection of36 physical payload directories, no apexd activation/signature/update verification.",
    "GetActivePackages reads unversioned directories and inner manifests. All36 payload manifests match outer original archives after complete disk extraction.",
    "Original resolver default ignores unmet constraints; strict mode rejects them. Per-target APEX strict limits validation scope by original design; its config bytes match default ART output. Global failure libdexfiled.so remains open.",
    "Native derive_classpath uses actual SDK properties and original fragments, no overrides; generates46 boot,14 dex2oat,14 systemserver,9 standalone paths. All69 unique jars contain executable DEX and originate in the same GSI.",
    "Existing regression DEX executes on original ART16 with these inputs, UID10000/zero caps, no LD_LIBRARY_PATH/preload/host ART/SDK runtime stubs. It is not a real APK journey."
  ],
  "scope": "Exact-source and separate execution evidence; full source/binary equivalence, service/isolation/graphics/app compatibility still not accepted"
